ft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">\n            关于Duwancho\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-wrap: wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 0.578px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          西达玛 Arbegona 咖啡产区距离 Gedeo 省府城市 Dilla 约 100 公里，和相邻的 Bensa 咖啡\n         </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          产区因 CoE 连续多年取得佳绩而闻名。该产区年降雨量约 2100 毫米，年平均气温 14-\n         </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          23 度。本次获奖的 ToH 蜜处理咖啡来自 Arbegona下的小镇 Duwancho，该村落下辖 213 家\n         </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          咖啡农户，除了种植咖啡树外，还种植有香蕉、竹子、百香果等作物。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-wrap: wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7ReEobaKx9mnXlz48aHcqFre4yDQXRbyfO88RMb4KGxLaFlkF8ZqZ1FW7YCmVK0zLqIxxD8HiaicZYA/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-wrap: wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 0.578px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Duwancho 咖啡处理站最初由居住 Arbegona 小镇周边 Duwancho, Rumudamo, Bochesa 和\n         </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Shamatanto 四个村庄的咖啡农合作社于 2019 年建立，所有的村庄都曾种植着一种名为\n         </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Duwancho 的本土植物俗称水莓树，因此合作社也可以称之为水莓合作社（我们音译为杜婉丘是为了和其他的处理站音译一致）。\n         </span>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-wrap: wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7ReEobaKx9mnXlz48aHcqFricd2vPsNjmHDtQTly19gbI82fdzuA7xV5BxGnrGMT5bWMOv7kiaKm8Qw/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-wrap: wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 0.578px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;text-wrap: wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          合作社从\n         </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          2021 年与 Yihonal 建立战略合作伙伴关系后，在合作社内建造了新的办公室、仓库、咖啡\n         </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          干燥床，并购买了更多用于扩建处理站的土地，从而形成了现在规模的 Duwancho 咖啡\n         </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          处理站，目前处理站主要制作传统的日晒、厌氧日晒和蜜处理等咖啡豆；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;text-wrap: wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          今年我们采购了2个Duwancho批次，之前售罄的Toh#1蜜处理是由Yihonal PLC公司提供参赛的批次；而这个日晒批次是来自Karamo Coffee Export公司，他们可能都与处理站有深入的贸易合作关系。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          更多咖啡豆，请关注淘宝店铺哈\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 14px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          <img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
